      "instructions": "---\nname: date-picker-regressions\ndescription: Use when changing the Bily date picker, Dynamic Island date controls, date presets, or ad-manager/view date state. This skill captures the invariants that prevent custom-range, mode-persistence, and preset-reopen regressions.\n---\n\n# Date Picker Regressions\n\nUse this skill for work touching:\n\n- `components/dynamic-island/date-picker/*`\n- `lib/dynamic-island/date-picker-state.ts`\n- `lib/hooks/use-ad-manager-ui.ts`\n- `lib/hooks/use-dynamic-island.ts`\n- `lib/livestore/schema/ad-manager-ui.ts`\n\n## Core model\n\n- Treat applied date state as two axes:\n  - `selectedDatePreset`: what label/range was applied (`today`, `last7d`, `custom`, `thisQuarter`, etc.).\n  - `selectedDateOption`: which picker mode produced it (`default`, `last`, `since`, `custom`, `period`).\n- Never derive the applied picker mode from the date shape alone when `selectedDateOption` already exists.\n- `Fixed` maps to `selectedDateOption = \"custom\"`.\n- `Last` maps to `selectedDateOption = \"last\"`.\n- `Since` maps to `selectedDateOption = \"since\"`.\n- `To date` maps to `selectedDateOption = \"period\"`.\n\n## Invariants\n\n- A fixed custom range that ends on today must reopen in `Fixed`, not `Since`.\n- A fixed custom range that happens to equal a known preset window like `last7d` must reopen in `Fixed`, not `Last`.\n- A `Last` or `Since` range that applies as `custom` must still reopen in the same mode that created it.\n- Explicit period presets like `thisWeek`, `thisMonth`, `thisQuarter`, `thisYear` must preserve the correct `periodUnit`.\n- The collapsed island chrome must not inject a separate \"reset/back to yesterday\" control.\n\n## Implementation rules\n\n- Prefer explicit LiveStore updates over `useEffect` synchronization.\n- Date-picker draft mutations should happen through explicit `setFieldValues()` patches from user actions.\n- Avoid adding new effects that \"repair\" `mode`, `from`, `to`, `presetId`, `lastValue`, `endingValue`, or `periodUnit` after render.\n- When seeding the date-picker form from applied state, call `buildDatePickerAppliedValues(dateFilter, selectedDatePreset, timezone, selectedDateOption)`.\n- When applying from the date-picker page, derive `selectedDateOption` from the draft `mode` before calling `setDateFilter(...)`.\n- If a quick preset is applied directly, pass the intended `selectedDateOption` explicitly to `setDateFilter(...)`.\n\n## High-risk files\n\n- `lib/dynamic-island/date-picker-state.ts`\n- `lib/hooks/use-dynamic-island.ts`\n- `lib/hooks/use-ad-manager-ui.ts`\n- `components/dynamic-island/date-picker/date-picker-panel.tsx`\n- `components/dynamic-island/date-picker/date-quick-presets.tsx`\n\n## Validation\n\nRun these after any change:\n\n```bash\ncd /Volumes/Diskxphi/bilyV1/app\nbun test lib/dynamic-island/date-picker-state.test.ts components/dynamic-island/date-picker/presets.test.ts lib/dynamic-island/date-picker-open-strategy.test.ts lib/livestore/queries.test.ts\nbunx tsc --noEmit\n```\n\nFor deeper context, read `references/regressions.md`.\n",
